msgstr "Type registreret undtagelsesaktivitet."

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_account_budget
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:om_account_budget.action_account_budget
msgid "Use budgets to compare actual with expected revenues and costs"
msgstr ""
"Brug budgetter til at sammenligne faktiske med forventede indtægter og "
"omkostninger"

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:om_account_budget.selection__account_budget__state__validate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_account_budget.view_account_budget_search
msgid "Validated"
msgstr "Valideret"

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_account_budget.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Vendor bills and purchase orders going over a budget always show a warning. "
"When blocking, only accounting managers can post or confirm them."
msgstr ""
"Leverandørfakturaer og indkøbsordrer, der overskrider et budget, viser altid"
" en advarsel. Ved blokering kan kun regnskabsansvarlige bogføre eller "
"bekræfte dem."

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_account_budget.field_account_budget_line__warning_level
msgid "Warning Level"
msgstr "Advarselsniveau"

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_budget.field_res_company__budget_exceeded_email
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_budget.field_res_config_settings__budget_exceeded_email
msgid ""
"When an expense line of a validated budget goes over its planned amount, its"
" responsible gets an email besides the To-Do activity."
msgstr ""
"Når en omkostningslinje i et valideret budget overskrider sit planlagte "
"beløb, får den ansvarlige en e-mail ud over To-Do-aktiviteten."

#. module: om_account_budget
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/om_account_budget/models/account_budget_line.py:0
msgid ""
"You have to enter at least a budgetary position or analytic account on a "
"budget line."
msgstr ""
"Du skal angive mindst en budgetposition eller et omkostningssted på en "
"budgetlinje."

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_account_budget.view_account_budget_form
msgid "e.g. Budget 2026"
msgstr "f.eks. Budget 2026"

